== Part 1: four stages in series, 200000 simulated requests (exercise model)
stage        mean ms    p50 ms    p99 ms
gateway         0.50      0.44      1.22
auth            1.00      0.85      2.82
store           3.00      2.39     10.23
replicate       3.50      3.04      8.94
sum             8.00               23.22   <- sums of the column above
end2end         8.00      7.45     16.36   <- the whole request, measured end to end
means add up (8.00 vs 8.00); p99 values do not (23.22 summed vs 16.36 end to end)

== Part 2: fan-out, the request waits for the slowest of k parallel calls
each call: 1.0 ms fixed + exponential with mean 2.0 ms; its own p99 = 10.21 ms
    k   requests with a call     predicted 1-0.99^k   request p99 ms
         slower than its p99                                        
    1                   1.0%                   1.0%            10.23
    5                   5.1%                   4.9%            13.37
   10                   9.8%                   9.6%            14.79
   50                  39.3%                  39.5%            18.05
  100                  63.3%                  63.4%            19.43
